  - ASML posts record €11,662 million Q3 net sales and says planned 2027 and 2028 supply will not meet customer demand  {compute-money}
  - Gartner: AI infrastructure needs $8.5 trillion of revenue against at most $3.6 trillion available, and 80% of neoclouds will not survive to 2030  {compute-money}
  - Jefferies: about half of hyperscalers' $2.3 trillion contracted backlog is owed to OpenAI and Anthropic  {compute-money}
  - Nvidia commits $250 million of compute over five years to UK agentic safety and security research  {}
  - Anthropic opens a Singapore office and signs an MOU with Singapore's digital ministry on evaluation and incident response  {}
  - Character.AI agrees to sell assets to Disney for $20 million, with wind-down the stated alternative  {}
