  - Anthropic tells pre-IPO investors third-quarter revenue was $16.8 billion, up from $11.6 billion in the second quarter  {compute-money}
  - Anthropic estimates distillation is 5 to 7 percent of revenue and tells investors that income will fall this quarter  {china-distillation-export-controls}
