  - TSMC reports third-quarter revenue of NT$1,494.24 billion, up 50.9% year on year, and guides Q4 to as much as $54.3 billion  {}
  - CNBC: 20 of the most valuable global AI and semiconductor stocks have shed more than $1 trillion this week  {compute-money}
  - CoreWeave shares fall 15.5% as the yield to maturity on its 2032 bond reaches 14.8%  {compute-money}
  - GlobalFoundries to operate two New York fabs under a US-Japan initiative providing up to $21 billion  {}
