  - Chainalysis counts over 138 million x402 agentic payments on Base, most of them smaller than a dime  {}
  - Anthropic says 0.01% of sampled US Claude conversations asked whom or what to vote for, and adds state-specific voting information  {}
=== 2026-10-16 :: China proposes AI export controls as agents break in
  - Meta releases Muse Spark Open, an 816B-parameter open-weight model tuned with Apple to run on Mac Studios  {}
  - Microsoft says it finished pre-training MAI-Base-2, 2.8 trillion parameters, on 16k GB200 GPUs over 38 days  {}
  - Anthropic gives six METR staff employee-level internal access and says it cannot veto their publications  {pacing-frontier-ai}
  - NVIDIA releases Nemotron 3.5 Super VL, a 120B-parameter open multimodal agentic model, plus 2-bit Bolt edge models  {}
